msgid ""
"Every resource type needs a standard resource, where all data should be "
"saved if no other resource is specified. If you want to change the standard "
"resource, use the <guibutton>Use as Standard</guibutton> button to select "
"it. You must have both read and write access to the new standard resource, "
"otherwise you will not be able to select it."
msgstr ""
